\n[00:47.31]But mum, there\'s a tear every time that I blink 但妈妈呀 我每一眨眼都会有夺眶的泪珠落下\n[00:51.14]\n[00:54.02]Oh I\'m in pieces, it\'s tearing me up, but I know 一切都在将我撕裂成碎片 但我知道\n[00:59.12]A heart that\'s broke is a heart that\'s been loved 破碎的心是源于被爱的那颗心啊\n[01:02.78]\n[01:03.00]So I\'ll sing Hallelujah 所以我轻吟祈祷着 哈利路亚\n[01:07.34]You were an angel in the shape of my mum 你就是位形神皆似妈妈的天使啊\n[01:12.57]When I fell down you\'d be there holding me up 每当我落入低谷 都有你陪伴守护\n[01:16.46]Spread your wings as you go 爱的羽翼展开遍布你所到之处\n[01:19.20]And when God takes you back he\'ll say Hallelujah 当上帝带你回来时 我们亦安慰念起 哈利路亚\n[01:24.62]You\'re home 你终于到家啦\n[01:25.67]\n[01:35.47]I fluffed the pillows, made the beds, stacked the chairs up 我轻抖着枕头 铺平了床 将椅子有序摆放\n[01:40.59]Folded your nightgowns neatly in a case 将你的睡袍叠好放进箱子\n[01:47.23]John says he\'d drive then put his hand on my cheek John说他负责开车 并一边将手伸过我脸颊\n[01:51.59]And wiped a tear from the side of my face 擦去我脸庞的泪花\n[01:55.27]\n[01:57.94]I hope that I see the world as you did cause I know 我希望我能看到你所看到的世界 我知道\n[02:03.08]A life with love is a life that\'s been lived 充满爱的生命势必将永生不已啊\n[02:07.12]\n[02:07.37]So I\'ll sing Hallelujah 所以我轻吟祈祷着 哈利路亚\n[02:11.38]You were an angel in the shape of my mum 你就是位形神皆似妈妈的天使啊\n[02:16.68]When I fell down you\'d be there holding me up 每当我落入低谷 都有你陪伴守护\n[02:20.41]Spread your wings as you go 爱的羽翼展开遍布你所到之处\n[02:23.12]And when God takes you back he\'ll say Hallelujah 当上帝带你回来时 我们亦安慰念起 哈利路亚\n[02:28.45]You\'re home 你终于到家啦\n[02:32.25]\n[03:12.20]Hallelujah 哈利路亚\n[03:15.27]You were an angel in the shape of my mum 你就是位形神皆似妈妈的天使啊\n[03:20.54]You got to see the person I have become 你应该好好看看如今的我呀\n[03:24.49]Spread your wings and I know 你爱的羽翼展开遍布你所到之处 我知道\n[03:27.36]That when God took you back, he said Hallelujah you\'re home 当上帝带你回来时 我们亦安慰念起 哈利路亚\n[03:36.10]音频工程师 : Chris Sclafani/Joe Rubel\n[03:36.73]和声 : Johnny McDaid\n[03:37.35]键盘 : Benny Blanco\n[03:37.98]混音助理 : Geoff Swan/Michael Freeman\n[03:38.60]母带工程师 : Stuart Hawkes\n[03:39.23]钢琴 : Johnny McD