在此间漂浮\n[02:27.03]And in your arms 我在你的怀中\n[02:31.26]I just wanna sway 只愿这样静静摇晃着\n[02:34.06]\n[02:35.01]Amazing day 美妙的一天\n[02:38.66]Amazing day 美妙的一天\n[02:42.36]Amazing day 美妙的一天\n[02:45.91]Amazing day 美妙的一天\n[02:49.39]\n[03:19.56]And I asked 我查阅了每本书籍\n[03:19.91]\"Can the birds in poetry chime?\" 每句诗文，每道鸣响\n[03:26.97]\"Can there be breaks in the chaos sometimes?\" “在时间的混沌里 是否存在着裂隙？“\n[03:34.20]Oh thanks God, must’ve heard when I prayed 你一定听到了我的祈祷\n[03:41.27]Cause now I always 因为此刻我只愿\n[03:44.15]Want to feel this way 停留在此间\n[03:50.05]Amazing day 美妙的一天\n[03:52.05]Amazing day 美妙的一天\n[03:56.05]Amazing day 美妙的一天\n[03:59.05]Oh amazing day 美妙的一天\n[04:03.05]Yeah, today 是今天','271.15','欧美流行,摇滚','http://127.0.0.1:9000/vibe-music-data/songCovers/c9efda4e-7bed-48c3-915d-3f0434b6bb48-blob','http://127.0.0.1:9000/vibe-music-data/songs/bf378bb2-930d-418f-99e2-29230c8ea582-M500004B21AP06TAg7.mp3','2015-03-06'),(546,142,'Adventure of a Lifetime','A Head Full of Dreams','[by:西瓜小猪]\n[00:00.00]作词 : Guy Berryman/Mikkel S. Eriksen/Tor Erik Hermansen/Chris Martin/Jonny Buckland/Will Champion\n[00:01.00]作曲 : Guy Berryman/Mikkel S. Eriksen/Tor Erik Hermansen/Chris Martin/Jonny Buckland/Will Champion\n[00:02.00]编曲 : Chris Martin/Guy Berryman/Jonny Buckland/Mikkel S. Eriksen/Tor Erik Hermansen/Will Champion\n[00:03.00]制作人 : Rik Simpson\n[00:34.96]Turn your magic on, Umi she\'d say 她对我说 绽放你的魅力\n[00:39.84]\n[00:41.03]Everything you want\'s a dream away 你想要的一切不再是梦想\n[00:43.91]\n[00:45.06]And we are legends, every day 我们都在创造奇迹\n[00:47.81]\n[00:49.20]That\'s what she told him 她这么对他说\n[00:51.04]\n[00:51.06]Turn your magic on, to me she\'d say 她对我说 绽放你的魅力\n[00:55.09]\n[00:57.83]Everything you want\'s a dream away 你想要的一切不再是梦想\n[01:00.38]\n[01:01.58]Under this pressure, under this weight 在这强大的压力下\n[01:05.40]\n[01:06.01]We are diamonds 我们就像一颗闪耀的钻石\n[01:07.37]\n[01:08.27]Now I feel my heart beating 我能感觉到心在跳动\n[01:10.54]\n[01:11.95]I feel my heart underneath my skin 血液在每寸肌肤下流淌\n[01:15.49]\n[01:16.18]I fee