u\'re sending out 你发自肺腑的爱\n[03:51.96]\n[03:57.98]And up there in the heavens 徜徉在天空之中\n[04:00.68]The explorers who\'ve all gathered by balloon 探险家乘着热气球 齐聚一堂\n[04:05.62]\n[04:07.71]Saw the world turn 看着这世界风云变幻\n[04:11.21]\n[04:11.81]Through Voyager Callisto Calliope Betelgeuse the Neon Moons 掠过旅行者号 飞越卡里斯托卫星 司赋星 参宿第四星 以及流光溢彩的人造卫星\n[04:20.47]\n[04:22.55]We\'re a slow burning tune 我们是悠扬舒缓的动人曲调\n[04:27.54]\n[04:29.71]But we\'ll touch down soon so will you 但是不久之后我们会着陆 你亦是如此\n[04:34.30]\n[04:36.44]And in this crazy world I do 在这个疯狂的世界里 我心怀希冀\n[04:41.87]\n[04:46.88]I just want you 我只想拥有你\n[04:49.12]\n[07:05.03]And up there in the heavens 徜徉在天空之中\n[07:07.68]Galileo saw reflections of us too 伽利略也注视着我们的身影\n[07:12.59]Pluribus unum unus mundus 合众为一 一元宇宙\n[07:16.48]All the satellites imbue 所有卫星传输着信号\n[07:19.93]The purple yellow green red orange and the blue 五彩斑斓你的色彩\n[07:25.23]Oh it\'s a crazy world it\'s true 这是一个疯狂的世界 千真万确\n[07:31.44]\n[07:32.67]Sing it out 大声歌唱\n[07:34.31]\n[07:35.40]Oh-oh-oh-oh oh-oh-oh-oh\n[07:41.76]\n[07:49.96]Oh-oh-oh-oh oh-oh-oh-oh\n[07:56.21]\n[08:04.90]And in this crazy world I do 在这个疯狂的世界里 我心怀希冀\n[08:10.53]\n[08:15.45]I just want 我只想\n[08:16.71]\n[08:19.46]In this crazy world it\'s true 在这个疯狂的世界里 千真万确\n[08:24.77]\n[08:29.73]I just want you 我只想拥有你\n[08:32.44]\n[08:47.88]Poets prophesy up in the blue 诗人在蔚蓝天空中书写预言\n[08:53.08]\n[08:54.19]Together that\'s how we\'ll make it through 齐心协力 我们终将穿越星际',NULL,'欧美流行,电子','http://127.0.0.1:9000/vibe-music-data/songCovers/83d84b11-8188-4e86-94f4-88628db65cb1-blob','http://127.0.0.1:9000/vibe-music-data/songs/0dba95f5-fc9a-4616-baa0-84e11cee12c7-M800003zeBF00qa43I.mp3','2021-03-05'),(551,142,'In My Place','A Rush of Blood to the Head','[00:05.00]纯音乐，请欣赏','226.72','欧美流行,摇滚','http://127.0.0.1:9000/vibe-music-data/songCovers/4a7654b9-bebe-4225-80d9-54394e2864ca-blob','http://127.0.0.1:9000/vibe-music-data/songs/5f42f1bc-1a11-48e6-905a-8e29cf75b22d-1864110418.mp3','2015-03-12'),(552,142,'Something Just Like This','Memories..