r Tom\'\n[00:40.400]\n[00:44.490]Take your protein pills and put your helmet on.\n[00:49.900]\n[00:50.780]Ten\n[00:51.850]Ground Control to Major Nine\'Eight\'SevenTom\n[00:53.690]\n[00:58.720]Commencing countdown\' engines on Six\'Five Four\n[01:04.890]\n[01:05.900]Check ignition and may God\'s love be with you Three\'Two\'One\n[01:14.400]\n[01:15.670]Liftoff\n[01:20.010]\n[01:23.100]This is Ground Control to Major Tom\'\n[01:27.190]\n[01:28.070]You\'ve really made the grade\n[01:31.530]\n[01:32.910]And the papers want to know whose shirts you wear\n[01:38.250]\n[01:39.890]Now it\'s time to leave the capsule if you dare.\n[01:45.360]\n[01:47.940]\"This is Major Tom to Ground Control\"\n[01:51.960]\n[01:52.780]I\'m stepping through the door\n[01:56.300]\n[01:57.630]And I\'m floating in a most peculiar way\n[02:03.170]\n[02:04.740]And the stars look very different today.\n[02:10.980]\n[02:12.110]For here\n[02:15.630]Am I sitting in a tin can\n[02:19.660]Far above the world\'\n[02:26.220]\n[02:26.720]Planet Earth is blue\n[02:29.430]And there\'s nothing I can do.\n[02:35.600]\n[03:03.340]Though I\'m past one hundred thousand miles\'\n[03:07.800]I\'m feeling very still\'\n[03:11.200]\n[03:12.520]And I think my spaceship knows which way to go.\n[03:17.430]\n[03:19.440]Tell my wife I love her very much she knows.\"\n[03:25.120]\n[03:27.260]Ground Control to Major Tom\n[03:30.090]Your circuits dead\' there\'s something wrong.\n[03:33.930]Can you hear me\' Major Tom?\n[03:37.400]Can you hear me\' Major Tom?\n[03:39.640]\n[03:40.780]Can you hear me\' Major Tom?\n[03:43.550]\n[03:44.300]Can you hear…\n[03:47.890] Am I floating round my tin can\'\n[03:50.720]\n[03:51.850]Far above the Moon\'\n[03:57.070]\n[03:58.650]Planet Earth is blue\n[04:01.230]And there\'s nothing I can do.\"','315.74','欧美流行','http://127.0.0.1:9000/vibe-music-data/songCovers/53cf9961-679c-47ca-ba03-44b36371d1d4-David Bowie-Space Oddity.jpg','http://127.0.0.1:9000/vibe-music-data/songs/54d4a68b-0cc2-442d-