dy love you\n[03:08.194] Before it\'s too late\n[03:23.580]\n[03:24.000] Producer : Glyn Johns\n[03:25.000] Lead Vocals : Don Henley\n[03:26.000] Piano : Glenn Frey\n[03:27.000] Electric Guitar : Bernie Leadon\n[03:28.000] Bass : Randy Meisner\n[03:29.000] Drums : Don Henley\n[03:30.000] Backing Vocals : Glenn Frey / Bernie Leadon / Randy Meisner\n[03:31.000] String Arrangement : Jim Ed Norman\n[03:32.000] Strings : London Philharmonic Orchestra\n[03:33.000] Recorded at Island Studios in London','213.76','欧美流行','http://127.0.0.1:9000/vibe-music-data/songCovers/21be6755-d80a-4e98-a857-118bacbc5646-Eagles-Desperado (2013 Remaster).jpg','http://127.0.0.1:9000/vibe-music-data/songs/194b1388-3460-4d56-a9c7-ba29110399db-Eagles - Desperado (2013 Remaster).mp3','2026-04-16'),(621,155,'Do Something','Long Road out of Eden','{\"t\":0,\"c\":[{\"tx\":\"作词: \"},{\"tx\":\"Don Henley\"},{\"tx\":\"/\"},{\"tx\":\"Glenn Frey\"},{\"tx\":\"/\"},{\"tx\":\"Timothy B. Schmit\"}]}\n{\"t\":375,\"c\":[{\"tx\":\"作曲: \"},{\"tx\":\"Don Henley\"},{\"tx\":\"/\"},{\"tx\":\"Glenn Frey\"},{\"tx\":\"/\"},{\"tx\":\"Timothy B. Schmit\"}]}\n[00:00.75]Do Something\n[00:02.75]Eagles\n[00:05.30]\n[00:11.01]I\'ve been walkin\' through the fields\n[00:15.86]And on the streets of town\n[00:20.41]Trying to make sense of what you left me\n[00:29.82]Everything that I believed in\n[00:37.37]Has been turned upside down\n[00:41.59]And now it seems the whole wide world\'s gone crazy\n[00:49.38]\n[00:54.03]But when I feel like giving up\n[00:57.90]And I\'m ready to walk away\n[01:02.85]In the stillness, I can hear\n[01:08.63]A voice inside me say\n[01:13.10]Do something\n[01:17.49]Do something\n[01:22.88]It\'s too late for saving face\n[01:29.85]Don\'t just stand there takin\' up space\n[01:35.14]Why don\'t you do something?\n[01:38.41]Do something\n[01:43.49]\n[01:46.96]It\'s not over\n[01:48.65]No, it\'s never too late\n[01:53.39]You were always on my side\n[02:01.89]Love was all we had\n[02:06.26]Now I sit and watch our love unraveling\n[02:14.45]\n[02:18.68]I pick up the morning paper\n[02:23.14]All the news is bad\n[02:28.15]How did we get on this road we\'re traveling?\n[02:35.65]\n[02:40.36]But when I feel like giving up\n[02:44.96]And there\'s nowhere left to go\n[02:50.43]That\'s the time I dig down deep\n[02:55.09]The only thing I know\n[03:01.19]Do something\n[03:03.83]Do something\n[03:09.56]Don\'t leave it up for someone else\n[03:16.76]Don\'t feel sorry for yourself\n[03:21.49]Why don\'t you do something?\n[03:25.00]Do something\n[03:30.55]\n[03:33.18]It\'s not over\n[03:35.15]No, it\'s never too late\n[03:41.62]Run away\n[03:47.53]You can\'t run away\n[03:53.37]For your honor\n[03:56.77]For your pride\n[03:58.96]You\'ll sleep better\n[04:01.63]Knowin\' you tried\n[04:07.39]To do something\n[04:10.22]Do something\n[04:15.53]It\'s too easy not to care\n[04:22.48]You\'re not ready for the rockin\' chair\n[04:27.83]Get up and do something\n[04:31.75]Do something\n[04:36.81]Don\'t wait too long\n[04:41.04]Even if it\'s wrong\n[04:43.72]You\'ve got to do something\n[04:47.41]Do something\n[04:52.89]It\'s not over\n[04:57.51]No, it\'s never too late\n[05:02.52]','312.48','欧美流行','http://127.0.0.1:9000/vibe-music-data/songCovers/7c3c12cc-b2a4-4d7d-88f3-23f9dad7401f-Eagles-Do Something.jpg','http://127.0.0.1:9000/vibe-music-data/songs/25ccd65a-18da-40a4-a517-10c217ab739e-Eagles - Do Something.mp3','2026-04-16'),(622,155,'Hotel California (Live)','惠威高低音试音碟','{\"t\":0,\"c\":[{\"tx\":\"作词: \"},{\"tx\":\"Glenn Frey\"},{\"tx\":\"/\"},{\"tx\":\"Don Felder\"},{\"tx\":\"/\"},{\"tx\":\"Don Henley\"}]}\n{\"t\":1000,\"c\":[{\"tx\":\"作曲: \"},{\"tx\":\"Don Felder\"},{\"tx\":\"/\"},{\"tx\":\"Don Henley\"}]}\n[02:09.727]On a dark desert highway\n[02:12.909]Cool wind in my hair\n[02:16.780]Warm smell of colitas\n[02:19.228]Rising up through the air\n[02:22.999]Up ahead in the distance\n[02:25.780]I saw a shimmering light\n[02:28.868]My head grew heavy and my sight grew dim\n[02:31.708]I had to stop for the night\n[02:35.238]There she stood in the doorway\n[02:38.490]I heard the mission bell\n[02:41.539]I was thinking to myself\n[02:44.790]This could be heaven or this could be hell\n[02:47.898]Then she lit up a candle\n[02:51.900]And she showed me the way\n[02:55.290]There were voices down in corridor\n[02:57.539]I thought i heard them say:\n[03:01.490]Welcome to the Hotel California\n[03:06.180]Such a lovely place\n[03:09.599](Such a lovely place)\n[03:10.990]Such a lovely face\n[03:13.229]Plenty of rooms at the Hotel California\n[03:19.490]Any time of year\n[03:21.539](Any time of year)\n[03:22.790]You can find it here\n[03:25.889]Her mind is tiffany- twisted\n[03:29.268]She got the Mercedes Benz\n[03:33.298]She got a lot of pretty pretty boys\n[03:35.708]She calls friends\n[03:38.809]How they dance in the courtyard\n[03:41.759]Sweet summer sweat\n[03:45.109]Some dance to remember\n[03:48.499]Some dance to forget\n[03:52.380]So l called up the captain:\n[03:54.890]Please bring me my wineHe said:\n[03:58.119]We havent had that spirit here since\n[04:01.189]1969\n[04:04.879]And still those voices are calling from far away\n[04:11.290]Wake you up in the middle of the night\n[04:13.969]Just to hear them say:\n[04:18.369]Welcome to the Hotel California\n[04:23.598]Such a lovely place\n[04:25.590](Such a lovely place)\n[04:26.900]Such a lovely face\n[04:31.000]They living it up at the Hotel California\n[04:36.158]What a  nice surprise\n[04:37.570](What a nice surprise)\n[04:39.500]Bring your alibis\n[04:43.848]Mirrors on the ceiling\n[04:46.900]Pink champage on ice\n[04:49.509]She said:\n[04:51.100]We are all just prisoners here\n[04:54.100]of our own device\n[04:56.569]In the master’s chambers\n[04:59.819]They gathered for the feast\n[05:02.929]They stabbed it with their steely knives\n[05:06.790]But they just cant kill the beast\n[05:09.519]Last thing I remember\n[05:11.969]I was\n[05:13.290]Running for the door\n[05:15.829]I had to find the passage Ba