pite of all the times the web is torn apart\n[05:28.53]And I\'ve been waiting in the weeds\n[05:33.04]Waiting for my time to come around again and\n[05:39.59]Hope is floating on the breeze\n[05:43.51]Carrying my soul high up above the ground and\n[05:50.14]I\'ve been keeping to myself\n[05:53.99]Knowing that the seasons are slowly changing\n[06:00.47]Even though you\'re with somebody else\n[06:04.18]He\'ll never love you like I do','466.49','原声带,欧美流行','http://127.0.0.1:9000/vibe-music-data/songCovers/d5c1db04-7f4c-4f12-9ee6-42564de6ae92-Eagles-Waiting in the Weeds.jpg','http://127.0.0.1:9000/vibe-music-data/songs/b5884b62-20e3-44b5-899c-80a6824d3a6d-Eagles - Waiting in the Weeds.mp3','2026-04-16'),(637,155,'What Do I Do With My Heart','Long Road out of Eden','{\"t\":0,\"c\":[{\"tx\":\"作词: \"},{\"tx\":\"Don Henley\"},{\"tx\":\"/\"},{\"tx\":\"Glenn Frey\"}]}\n{\"t\":1000,\"c\":[{\"tx\":\"作曲: \"},{\"tx\":\"Don Henley\"},{\"tx\":\"/\"},{\"tx\":\"Glenn Frey\"}]}\n[00:24.440]You don\'t have to say a word\n[00:30.460]I can see it in your eyes\n[00:36.660]I know what you wanna say\n[00:42.830]It\'s so hard to say goodbye\n[00:48.350]I can hold back my tears\n[00:51.470]And try to be strong\n[00:54.680]While our love is fallin\' apart\n[01:00.910]I know what I\'ll say\n[01:03.700]If you walk away\n[01:06.740]But what do I do\n[01:10.220]What do I do with my heart?\n[01:19.690]I\'m not gonna say a word\n[01:25.580]I know I can\'t change your mind\n[01:31.700]You know where you need to go\n[01:37.850]I know I\'ll be left behind\n[01:43.850]I won\'t hold you back\n[01:46.650]I won\'t stand in your way\n[01:49.760]If you need to make a new start\n[01:55.890]But I still wanna know\n[01:58.920]When my arms let you go\n[02:02.450]What do I do\n[02:05.470]What do I do with my heart?\n[02:14.740]Oh, girl, don\'t you remember?\n[02:18.910]It was not so long ago\n[02:22.240]We were makin\' plans for two\n[02:25.000]Just me and you\n[02:27.540]Now you tell me that you\'ve found somebody