here\n[00:33.090]She once was a true love of mine\n[00:41.840]Tell her to make me a cambric shirt\n[00:47.720](On the side of a hill in the deep forest green)\n[00:50.630]Parsley, sage, rosemary & thyme\n[00:54.340](Tracing a sparrow on snow-crested ground)\n[00:58.810]Without no seams nor needlework\n[01:02.490](Blankets and bedclothes a child of the mountains)\n[01:06.880]Then she\'ll be a true love of mine\n[01:10.950](Sleeps unaware of the clarion call)\n[01:16.020]Tell her to find me an acre of land\n[01:19.490](On the side of a hill, a sprinkling of leaves)\n[01:23.580]Parsley, sage, rosemary, & thyme\n[01:27.220](Washes the grave with silvery tears)\n[01:31.860]Between the salt water and the sea strand\n[01:36.160](A soldier cleans and polishes a gun)\n[01:39.970]Then she\'ll be a true love of mine\n[01:49.430]Tell her to reap it in a sickle of leather\n[01:53.830](War bellows, blazing in scarlet battalions)\n[01:56.930]Parsley, sage, rosemary & thyme\n[02:00.650](Generals order their soldiers to kill)\n[02:05.240]And  gather it all in a bunch of heather\n[02:08.670](And to fight for a cause they\'ve long ago forgotten)\n[02:13.590]Then she\'ll be a true love of mine\n[02:22.350]Are you going to Scarborough Fair?\n[02:30.530]Parsley, sage, rosemary & thyme\n[02:39.170]Remember me to one who lives there\n[02:47.450]She once was a true love of mine','190.01','摇滚,欧美流行','http://127.0.0.1:9000/vibe-music-data/songCovers/08f08ede-5d86-4350-9c38-93194ec910dd-Simon & Garfunkel-Scarborough Fair _ Canticle.jpg','http://127.0.0.1:9000/vibe-music-data/songs/82fe89d0-f9d6-4444-8b7a-f1120be39f95-Simon & Garfunkel - Scarborough Fair _ Canticle.mp3','2026-04-16'),(724,183,'Across The Universe (Remastered)','Let It Be (Remastered)','{\"t\":0,\"c\":[{\"tx\":\"作词: \"},{\"tx\":\"John Lennon\",\"li\":\"http://p1.music.126.net/90xxpujg22USIJeYAIcY4A==/257285720916738.jpg\",\"or\":\"orpheus://nm/artist/home?id=35333&type=artist\"},{\"tx\":\"/\"},{\"tx\":\"Paul McCartney\",\"li\":\"