t\":1000,\"c\":[{\"tx\":\"作曲: \"},{\"tx\":\"Porl Thompson\"},{\"tx\":\"/\"},{\"tx\":\"Laurence Tolhurst\"},{\"tx\":\"/\"},{\"tx\":\"Boris Williams\"},{\"tx\":\"/\"},{\"tx\":\"Simon Gallup\"},{\"tx\":\"/\"},{\"tx\":\"Roger O\'Donnell\"},{\"tx\":\"/\"},{\"tx\":\"Robert Smith\"}]}\n[01:53.900]I\'ve been looking so long at these pictures of you\n[01:58.190]That I almost believe that they\'re real\n[02:03.660]I\'ve been living so long with my pictures of you\n[02:09.800]That I almost believe that the pictures are\n[02:14.800]All I can feel\n[02:20.510]\n[02:37.570]Remembering You standing quiet in the rain\n[02:43.500]As I ran to your heart to be near\n[02:49.110]And we kissed as the sky fell in\n[02:52.600]Holding you close\n[02:54.730]How I always held close in your fear\n[03:00.960]Remembering\n[03:01.520]You running soft through the night\n[03:06.250]You were bigger and brighter and wider than snow\n[03:11.910]And screamed at the make-believe\n[03:14.680]Screamed at the sky\n[03:17.230]And you finally found all your courage\n[03:22.140]To let it all go\n[03:39.280]\n[03:45.270]Remembering\n[03:46.900]You fallen into my arms\n[03:51.070]Crying for the death of your heart\n[03:56.420]You were stone white\n[03:58.420]So delicate\n[03:59.900]Lost in the cold\n[04:01.720]You were always so lost in the dark\n[04:08.400]Remembering\n[04:09.470]You how you used to be\n[04:14.210]Slow drowned\n[04:15.350]You were angels\n[04:16.920]So much more than everything\n[04:19.899]Hold for the last time then slip away quietly\n[04:25.440]Open my eyes\n[04:27.630]But I never see anything\n[04:31.240]\n[04:32.420]If only I\'d thought of the right words\n[04:36.340]I could have held on to your heart\n[04:41.840]If only I\'d thought of the right words\n[04:47.130]I wouldn\'t be breaking apart\n[04:51.610]All my pictures of you\n[04:55.030]\n[05:15.500]Looking so long at these pictures of you\n[05:20.690]But I never hold on to your heart\n[05:26.900]Looking so long for the words to be true\n[05:31.890]But always just breaking apart\n[05:36.060]My pictures of you\n[05:40.120]\n[06:21.820]There was nothing in the world\n[06:24.310]That I ever wanted more\n[06:27.610]Than to feel you deep in my heart\n[06:33.310]There was nothing in the world\n[06:35.980]That I ever wanted more\n[06:39.700]Than to never feel the breaking apart\n[06:43.390]All my pictures of you\n[06:47.490]','448.86','欧美流行','http://127.0.0.1:9000/vibe-music-data/songCovers/2d9f93f0-e4ba-45d3-86f2-0cee6e8efa18-The Cure-Pictures Of You (Remastered).jpg','http://127.0.0.1:9000/vibe-music-data/songs/61484edb-9163-43a7-9f0f-6bef717c4e66-The Cure - Pictures Of You (Remastered).mp3','2026-04-16'),(744,184,'Sugar Girl','Join the Dots: B-Sides & Rarities 1978-2001','[01:30.57]Oh I wish I could find it funny\n[01:35.39]You laughing like that\n[01:39.90]But instead I change into a rage\n[01:45.47]Run around\n[01:47.57]Without a face\n[01:50.00]I wish I could find it funny\n[01:53.87]When you never come back\n[01:58.62]But I don\'t suppose I\'ll ever know\n[02:03.96]The how to keep you\n[02:06.16]Goodbye sugar girl\n[02:10.60]Goodbye sugar girl','195.74','欧美流行','http://127.0.0.1:9000/vibe-music-data/songCovers/cb912145-09bd-48b2-984f-cf70bb675962-The Cure-Sugar Girl.jpg','http://127.0.0.1:9000/vibe-music-data/songs/985831b4-40eb-4d0d-9150-1907415c70a0-The Cure - Sugar Girl.mp3','2026-04-16'),(745,184,'To The Sky','Join the Dots: B-Sides & Rarities 1978-2001','[01:09.400]One perfect morning\n[01:13.400]I was all alone\n[01:17.400]Listening to\n[01:21.400]The blaze of summer\n[01:27.400]Drifting, I was falling\n[01:35.400]I was floating in a golden haze\n[01:36.400]Breathing in the sky blue sounds\n[01:40.400]Of memories of other days\n[01:45.400]And in my dreams I was a child\n[01:55.400]Flowers in my mouth and in my eyes\n[02:06.400]And I was floating through the colors of a sky\n[02:11.400]Up to the stars and angels\n[02:20.400]Up, up, up to Heaven\n[02:27.400]Up, up, up forever\n[02:36.400]Up, up